{"availability":"available","full":"DevinoSolutions/upup","name":"upup","description":"Open-source TypeScript file uploader for React, Vue, Svelte, Angular, Preact, Next.js and vanilla JS. Drag-and-drop, presigned-URL uploads to AWS S3, DigitalOcean Spaces, Backblaze B2, Azure, MinIO and other S3 providers, from device, Google Drive, OneDrive, Dropbox or Box.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":27,"forks":13,"created":"2023-05-03T16:12:59Z","updated":"2026-10-10T19:58:17Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://useupup.com","topics":["angular","aws-s3","azure-storage","backblaze","drag-and-drop","dropbox","dropzone","file-transfer","file-upload","file-uploader","google-drive","minio","nextjs","preact","react","s3","svelte","typescript","uploader","vue"],"demo":"https://useupup.com/#demo","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.640Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.640Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.640Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T02:35:51.859Z","stars":27,"forks":13},{"at":"2026-10-09T13:19:55.308Z","stars":27,"forks":13},{"at":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.640Z","stars":27,"forks":13}],"technologies":["React","Next.js","Vue","Svelte","Angular"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A headless upload engine with native, DOM-identical UI packages for React, Vue, Svelte, Angular, Vanilla JS, and Preact — with optional server-mode uploads, cloud drives, camera, screen capture, and link imports.","upup is a free, MIT-licensed file uploader built as one headless @useupup/core engine with a matching native UI for every major framework. React is the visual canon; the Vue, Svelte, Angular, Vanilla, and Preact ports render the same DOM with the same props, verified by a cross-framework parity harness (structure, classes, accessibility attributes, text). Uploads go straight from the browser to any S3-compatible storage over presigned URLs, signed either by a route you write (Client Mode) or by @useupup/server on your backend, with an HMAC-signed trust model and server-side cloud-drive OAuth…"],"features":["Headless core. @useupup/core is a zero-framework-dependency engine: file state, an upload pipeline (compression, HEIC→JPEG, EXIF stripping, checksums, thumbnails, optional Web Worker offload), cloud-drive plugins, i18n,…","Native UI for six frameworks. React, Vue, Svelte, Angular, Vanilla JS, and Preact — same DOM structure, same upup- classes, enforced by a cross-framework parity harness.","Client or Server mode. Direct browser → storage presigned uploads in both: sign them with a route you write, or let @useupup/server sign them with an HMAC-signed trust model (signed length, key/uploadId binding,…","S3-compatible storage. AWS S3, Cloudflare R2, MinIO, DigitalOcean Spaces, Backblaze B2, Wasabi — any S3-compatible endpoint.","Cloud drives. Import from Google Drive, OneDrive, Dropbox, and Box, in client or server mode."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DevinoSolutions/upup/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"94cf4602925564df2cc8a146ef672998f20391134f15dbb6b9d7b646e767f2c9","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T13:19:55.412Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.726Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A headless upload engine with native, DOM-identical UI packages for React, Vue, Svelte, Angular, Vanilla JS, and Preact — with optional server-mode uploads, cloud drives, camera, screen capture, and link imports.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DevinoSolutions/upup/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"94cf4602925564df2cc8a146ef672998f20391134f15dbb6b9d7b646e767f2c9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DevinoSolutions/upup/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.726Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T19:58:17Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DevinoSolutions/upup/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T23:19:59.727Z","hash":"94c